1
00:00:00,375 --> 00:00:01,292
Who are you?

2
00:00:02,043 --> 00:00:04,295
She looks familiar.

3
00:00:04,295 --> 00:00:05,922
I've seen her
somewhere before.

4
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:10,010
Wait, was it at the
Knights' stadium?

5
00:00:10,593 --> 00:00:11,594
I'm Ted's girlfriend.

6
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:12,971
So you're the girl

7
00:00:12,971 --> 00:00:14,305
Ted's been
telling me about.

8
00:00:14,931 --> 00:00:16,391
He said you
were beautiful.

9
00:00:16,641 --> 00:00:17,767
He wasn't exaggerating.

10
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,728
That's very
kind of you.

11
00:00:21,938 --> 00:00:23,940
Beauty and
the beast, huh?

12
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:26,735
I don't understand
what you see in him.

13
00:00:26,735 --> 00:00:27,861
The guy's a cripple.

14
00:00:27,861 --> 00:00:29,612
He can't even
afford a decent gift.

15
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:31,698
You think our
gifts are cheap?

16
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:33,283
Why don't you
show us

17
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:33,992
something better?

18
00:00:35,285 --> 00:00:36,119
Well,

19
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:36,995
I didn't have
much time

20
00:00:36,995 --> 00:00:38,413
to prepare, but...

21
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:40,457
I pulled a little
something from

22
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:41,624
my own collection.

23
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:42,917
Hopefully Grandpa
doesn't mind.

24
00:00:43,918 --> 00:00:45,962
Oh, from your
"collection", huh?

25
00:00:46,463 --> 00:00:47,380
You sure it's
not some junk

26
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:48,339
you brought
from the attic?

27
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:50,800
So hurry up
and show us

28
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,177
what kind of
trash you brought.

29
00:00:55,096 --> 00:00:57,515
Nothing extravagant,
just a painting.

30
00:00:58,391 --> 00:01:00,727
A painting? Please.

31
00:01:00,727 --> 00:01:02,062
How expensive
could that be?

32
00:01:03,521 --> 00:01:05,732
It's Picasso's
Weeping Woman.

33
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:07,734
Worth around three
million dollars.
